cera och handlägga uppdraget. Avgiften bestäms av SCB i enlighet med avgiftsförordningen (1992:191) och myndighetens instruktion. Storleken på avgiften varierar beroende på uppdragets omfattning och komplexitet."},"dct:identifier":"2021000837","dct:type":{"@id":"http://purl.org/adms/publishertype/NationalAuthority"},"foaf:mbox":[{"@id":"mailto:https://www.scb.se/"},{"@id":"mailto:px@scb.se"}],"foaf:name":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Statistikmyndigheten SCB - Statistiska centralbyrån"},"foaf:page":{"@id":"https://www.scb.se"},"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#sameAs":[{"@id":"https://bolagsverket.se/vardefulla-datamangder-api/dataset/scb"},{"@id":"https://bolagsverket.se/vardefulla-datamangder-bulkfil/dataset/scb"},{"@id":"https://www.dataportal.se/organisations/612_5672"},{"@id":"https://www.dataportal.se/organisations/612_5673"},{"@id":"https://www.dataportal.se/organisations/778_1b1c866785c22474e0adb68eec49a4b2"}],"https://www.w3.org/ns/org#classification":{"@id":"https://dataportal.se/concepts/orgAspects/feeFinanzing"}},{"@id":"https://statistikdatabasen.scb.se/contactperson/1187","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Individual","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#fn":"Esbjörn Pettersson","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasEmail":{"@id":"mailto:mark.vatten.gis@scb.se"}},{"@id":"https://statistikdatabasen.scb.se/dataset/TAB5785","@type":"dcat:Dataset","dcat:contactPoint":{"@id":"https://statistikdatabasen.scb.se/contactperson/1187"},"dcat:distribution":[{"@id":"https://statistikdatabasen.scb.se/distribution/en/TAB5785"},{"@id":"https://statistikdatabasen.scb.se/distribution/sv/TAB5785"}],"dcat:keyword":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Environment"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Land use in proximity to shoreline"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Shorelines and islands"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Miljö"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Strandnära markanvändning"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Stränder och öar"}],"dcat:landingPage":[{"@id":"https://www.statistikdatabasen.scb.se/go